# Pairs with TypeOK. A served call that consumes no body-declared origin
# reports an identity outside the header domain.
MODULE: ReceiverActedIdentityLeavesDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a peer-read call's acting identity leaves the header domain

--- FIND
        acted == IF gate # "pass" THEN NoHeader ELSE verb[2]
--- REPLACE
        acted == IF gate # "pass" THEN NoHeader ELSE IF verb[2] = NoHeader THEN "anonymous" ELSE verb[2]
--- END